{"version":1,"content":"<p>OpenAI宣佈推出名為「Businesses in ChatGPT（ChatGPT企業信息）」的測試版服務，為企業提供專屬的商業信息管理平台。這一舉措被視為直接挑戰Google多年來在搜索和地圖服務中建立的Google Business Profiles（企業商家資料）體系。隨着ChatGPT周活躍用户規模達到12億，OpenAI正試圖將這一龐大流量入口打造成為企業觸達潛在客户的新渠道。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585860.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T05:53:15.455691+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T05:37:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T05:46:39.945014+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T05:46:39.945014+00:00","content_hash":"6a46c7c03e7dcf36436713cfc940f6b7b2acae2d1fba939e1c7362fff5f7f933","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}